<h1>Act One</h1>
<p class="bai-play">SCENE: A kitchen. Morning.</p>
<p class="bai-play">MARY: Good morning, John.</p>
<p class="bai-play">JOHN: (yawning) Is the kettle on?</p>
<p class="bai-play">MARY enters carrying a tray.</p>
<p>Between the acts the stage is dark.</p>
<p class="bai-play">JOHN: Thank you.</p>
